tp://data.europeana.eu/concept/2092"></dcterms:medium><edm:europeanaProxy>true</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_ubb_F_III_0008"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/9200211/en_list_one_ubb_F_III_0008"/><edm:type>TEXT</edm:type></ore:Proxy><ore:Proxy rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/provider/9200211/en_list_one_ubb_F_III_0008"><dc:creator>Jerg, Philosophus</dc:creator><dc:creator>Georgius, Antiochenus</dc:creator><dc:creator>Māšā'allāh, Ibn-Aṯarī</dc:creator><dc:creator>Qabīṣī, Abu-'ṣ-Ṣaqr ʿAbd-al-ʿAzīz Ibn-ʿUṯmān al-</dc:creator><dc:creator>Ibn-Abī-'r-Riǧāl, Abu-'l-Ḥasan ʿAlī</dc:creator><dc:creator>Makīn Ibn-al-ʿAmīd, Ǧirǧīs al-</dc:creator><dc:creator>Guilelmus, de Aragonia</dc:creator><dc:creator>Johannes, Hispalensis</dc:creator><dc:creator>Johannes, Hispalensis</dc:creator><dc:creator>Eschuid, Johannes</dc:creator><dc:creator>Sahl Ibn-Bišr</dc:creator><dc:creator>Dorotheus, Sidonius</dc:creator><dc:creator>Hippocrates</dc:creator><dc:creator>Albertus, Magnus</dc:creator><dc:creator>Ptolemaeus, Claudius</dc:creator><dc:creator>Arnoldus, de Villa Nova</dc:creator><dc:creator>Aristoteles</dc:creator><dc:creator>Grosseteste, Robertus</dc:creator><dc:creator>Thomas, de Cantiprato</dc:creator><dc:creator>Kindī, Ja'kûb Ibn-Ishâk al</dc:creator><dc:creator>Hermannus, Dalmata</dc:creator><dc:creator>Abū-Maʿšar, Ǧaʿfar Ibn-Muḥammad</dc:creator><dc:date>middle of the 14th century - beginning of the 15th century</dc:date><dc:description>This composite manuscript of mainly astrological-astronomical content includes a journal of weather observations kept over seven years, the so-called Basler Wettermanuskript. It records meteorological observations in daily entries from January 1, 1399 until March 21, 1406, without a single gap. Towards the end of the journal, the entries become more schematic, until finally they transition to tables of the positions of the planets with only occasional comments on the weather. The volume is from the Dominican Convent of Basel.</dc:description><dc:format>165 ff., 14,5 x 21,5 cm</dc:format><dc:identifier>doi:10.5076/e-codices-ubb-F-III-0008</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/ubb/F-III-0008</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>Basel, Universitätsbibliothek, F III 8</dc:identifier><dc:publisher>e-codices - Virtual Manuscript Library of Switzerland</dc:publisher><dc:language>Latin</dc:language><dc:relation>Aus: HAN. Verbundkatalog Handschriften - Archive - Nachlässe.</dc:relation><dc:rights>e-codices / Basel, Universitätsbibliothek (cf. http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/about/terms)</dc:rights><dc:source rdf:resource="http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/ubb/F-III-0008"></dc:source><dc:title>Basel, Universitätsbibliothek, F III 8 : Astronomica et astrologica, de tempestate</dc:title><dc:type>Manuscript</dc:type><dcterms:medium>Parchment</dcterms:medium><edm:europeanaProxy>false</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_ubb_F_III_0008"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/provider/9200211/en_list_one_ubb_F_III_0008"/><edm:type>TEXT</edm:type></ore:Proxy><edm:EuropeanaAggregation rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/9200211/en_list_one_ubb_F_III_0008"><edm:aggregatedCHO rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_ubb_F_III_0008"/><edm:datasetName>9200211_Ag_EU_e-Codices</edm:datasetName><edm:country>Switzerland</edm:country><edm:preview rdf:resource="http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/loris/ubb/ubb-F-III-0008/ubb-F-III-0008_002r.jp2/full/full/0/default.jpg"/><edm:landingPage rdf:resource="https://www.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_ubb_F_III_0008"/><edm:language>mul</edm:language><edm:rights rdf:resource="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0/"/><edm:completeness>10</edm:completeness><dcterms:created>2016-09-09T12:35:37.321Z</dcterm